A plain new request, kept out of the preloaded inbox so you have something to send while
the application is running:

    ./dev.sh send new-request

Within one poll interval a new case should appear in the case list. This is the fixture to
use when you want to watch the whole path - poll, claim, parse, create case - happen live in
the log rather than during startup.
